ructed by replacing $f(x)$ with zero:\n\n$$\na(x){y}^{″}+b(x){y}^{′}+c(x)y=0\n$$\n\nTherefore, in our case, the associated homogeneous equation is\n\n$$\n(x-2){y}^{″}+{y}^{′}+3y=0.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/state.json" "file_sha256" "9fa1041c8920fa9ae00c2a70d0ddbeafb4ca245ae19850ea3678670e61672839"} {"question" "q-130994" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "150eef360fa6ca4370556dd37534d366c488edc736bb946f58aa913b35ef5b0b"} {"question" "q-130994" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/state.json" "file_sha256" "9fa1041c8920fa9ae00c2a70d0ddbeafb4ca245ae19850ea3678670e61672839"} {"question" "q-130994" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "(x-2){y}^{″}+{y}^{′}+3y=0"] ["math" "-2{y}^{″}+{y}^{′}=x"] ["math" "x{y}^{″}+{y}^{′}+3y=0"] ["math" "x{y}^{″}+{y}^{′}+3y=x"] ["math" "{y}^{″}+{y}^{′}+3y=\\frac{x}{x-2}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/state.json" "file_sha256" "9fa1041c8920fa9ae00c2a70d0ddbeafb4ca245ae19850ea3678670e61672839"} {"question" "q-130994" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "(x-2){y}^{″}+{y}^{′}+3y=0"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/state.json" "file_sha256" "9fa1041c8920fa9ae00c2a70d0ddbeafb4ca245ae19850ea3678670e61672839"} {"question" "q-13